It reads the sensors and gateways of the user's own SensorPush account through
the official SensorPush Gateway Cloud API
(https://www.sensorpush.com/gateway-cloud-api, Swagger definition
https://api.sensorpush.com/api/v1/support/swagger/swagger-v1.json), with the
e-mail address and the password of that account. This integration is not
affiliated with nor endorsed by SensorPush (Cousins & Sears LLC). The endpoints,
fields and units follow the official Swagger definition and the answers of the
live API; the cadence of the readings was compared with the Home Assistant
"SensorPush Cloud" integration (Apache-2.0). No code is taken from it nor from
its libraries.
